.SH "NAME"
pcre2_set_compile_extra_options \- set compile time extra options
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
.ss \n[.ss]
.nf
.fam C
\f(CR\&#include <pcre2.h>

int\fP \f(CBpcre2_set_compile_extra_options\fP\f(CR(pcre2_compile_context *\fP\f(CIccontext\fP\f(CR,
                                    uint32_t\fP \f(CIoptions\fP\f(CR);\fP
.fam
.fi
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
This function sets additional option bits for \f(CBpcre2_compile()\fP that are
housed in a compile context. It completely replaces all the bits. The extra
options are:
.sp
.RS 4
.PD 0
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ALLOW_LOOKAROUND_BSK\fP
.ad l
Allow \f(CI\(rsK\fP in lookarounds
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ALLOW_SURROGATE_ESCAPES\fP
.ad l
Allow \f(CI\(rsx{d800}\fP to \f(CI\(rsx{dfff}\fP
in UTF\-8 and UTF\-32 modes
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ALT_BSUX\fP
.ad l
Extended alternate \f(CI\(rsu\fP, \f(CI\(rsU\fP, and
\f(CI\(rsx\fP handling
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_BSD\fP
.ad l
\f(CI\(rsd\fP remains ASCII in UCP mode
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_BSS\fP
.ad l
\f(CI\(rss\fP remains ASCII in UCP mode
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_BSW\fP
.ad l
\f(CI\(rsw\fP remains ASCII in UCP mode
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_DIGIT\fP
.ad l
\f(CI[:digit:]\fP and \f(CI[:xdigit:]\fP POSIX classes
remain ASCII in UCP mode
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ASCII_POSIX\fP
.ad l
POSIX classes remain ASCII in
UCP mode
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_BAD_ESCAPE_IS_LITERAL\fP
.ad l
Treat all invalid escapes as
a literal following character
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_CASELESS_RESTRICT\fP
.ad l
Disable mixed ASCII/non\-ASCII
case folding
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_ESCAPED_CR_IS_LF\fP
.ad l
Interpret \f(CI\(rsr\fP as \f(CI\(rsn\fP
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_MATCH_LINE\fP
.ad l
Pattern matches whole lines
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_MATCH_WORD\fP
.ad l
Pattern matches "words"
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_NEVER_CALLOUT\fP
.ad l
Disallow callouts in pattern
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_NO_BS0\fP
.ad l
Disallow \f(CI\(rs0\fP (but not \f(CI\(rs00\fP or \f(CI\(rs000\fP)
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_PYTHON_OCTAL\fP
.ad l
Use Python rules for octal
.TP 26
\f(CBPCRE2_EXTRA_TURKISH_CASING\fP
.ad l
Use Turkish I case folding
.PD
.RE
.PP
.ad l
